Third-party software preinstalled by BestROM
============================================

The APKs in this directory are not BestROM's work and are not open source.
They are copied into the image byte for byte and installed on first boot as
ordinary, removable user apps. Each is redistributed under the permission its
author gives for preinstalling it in a ROM; that permission is the only thing
that makes the preload lawful, so it is recorded here rather than only in a
commit message.

Neither app is covered by the generated NOTICE for the image: PRODUCT_COPY_FILES
attaches no Soong license metadata. This file is the attribution.


MiXplorer
---------

MiXplorer, Copyright (c) Hootan Parsa (MiProjects), https://mixplorer.com

Proprietary freeware. No source is published. Distributed by the author from
his own Google Drive, linked from mixplorer.com and from the XDA thread
https://xdaforums.com/t/app-2-3-mixplorer-v6-x-released-fully-featured-file-manager.1523691/

The author's grant, as quoted from that thread in IzzyOnDroid repository issue
44 (https://gitlab.com/IzzyOnDroid/repo/-/issues/44):

    All developers and companies are allowed to add MiXplorer and its free
    addons in their ROMs as pre-installed apps. Sharing the modified APK file
    and with different signature is not permitted.

Second-hand quote, not read at the primary source: the XDA post and
mixplorer.com/legal/ both refuse automated requests from this build host. See
README.md; archiving the original post is a release task.

BestROM therefore ships the author's own signed APK unmodified, and never
repacks, re-zipaligns or re-signs it.


Via Browser
-----------

Via Browser, Copyright (c) Various Tu, https://viayoo.com

Proprietary freeware. No source is published. Redistributed as the author's
own signed APK, unmodified.

No written grant for preinstalling Via in a ROM is recorded in this tree - it
was added before this file existed. Getting one, or dropping the preload, is an
open item; it is not settled by the fact that the app is free of charge.
